# Formspree endpoint for the contact form.
# Get this from https://formspree.io after creating your form.
# Without this, the contact form degrades to a "please email me directly" notice.
# Format: https://formspree.io/f/xxxxxxxx (get yours from the Formspree dashboard)
VITE_FORMSPREE_ENDPOINT=
# Sentry DSN for error tracking.
# Use an EU-region project (ingest.de.sentry.io) for GDPR compliance.
# Leave empty to disable error tracking in development.
# EU region (GDPR-friendly) — matches CSP in vercel.json
VITE_SENTRY_DSN=https://xxxx@oxxxx.ingest.de.sentry.io/xxxx